<h2 id="reference-impl" style="color:#1565c0;font-size:1.22em;font-weight:650;border-left:4px solid #42a5f5;padding-left:10px;margin-top:1.1em">5. Reference implementation</h2>

Clitics four-tab refactor (`REFACTOR_CLITICS_FOUR_TAB_SUITE.md`) is the gold **grid contract** example:

- Tab 2 object-action: Word (verb lemma) + Form Example + subject/object person + DO/IO + Pro/Enclitic → Practice note assembly → paragraph pool/bracket.
- Tab 1/3: about-yourself suite (person + conjugation in Practice note).
- Tab 4: se patterns (agreement + conjugation).

Copy this pattern for new scopes rather than ad-hoc column strings in table builders.

