<h2 id="ui-verification-gate" style="color:#1565c0;font-size:1.22em;font-weight:650;border-left:4px solid #42a5f5;padding-left:10px;margin-top:1.1em">6. UI verification gate (generate + refactor)</h2>

Any **`generate`** step or manual refactor that touches **knowledge pages**, **practice pages**, or **fetch → table builders** must pass **three layers** before the phase is marked complete. Portable rationale: war stories [153](war_stories/WAR_STORIES.md#war-story-153), [154](war_stories/WAR_STORIES.md#war-story-154); clitics application: [129](war_stories/WAR_STORIES_PROJECT_SPECIFIC.md#war-story-129).

<table>
<thead>
<tr style="background:#1565c0;color:white"><th>Layer</th><th>Proves</th><th>Required artifact</th></tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td style="background:#e3f2fd"><strong>1 — Compile</strong></td><td style="background:#e8f5e9">Page modules parse (no mid-import syntax errors)</td><td style="background:#e8f5e9"><code>cd apps/web && npm run build</code></td></tr>
<tr><td style="background:#e3f2fd"><strong>2 — Render</strong></td><td style="background:#e8f5e9">Fetch → buildRows → table mounts without throw</td><td style="background:#e8f5e9">Vitest + RTL + mocked fetch — <strong>one test per tab/route variant</strong></td></tr>
<tr><td style="background:#e3f2fd"><strong>3 — E2E</strong></td><td style="background:#fff3e0">Navigation + practice flow (release / Phase 6)</td><td style="background:#fff3e0">Playwright mocked spec or <code>pwlad temp</code></td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>

**Boundary coercion (layer 2 code, not optional):**

- Fetch helpers: coerce list responses — non-array → `[]` (see `cliticsFetch.asFetchRows`).
- Table builders: `Array.isArray` before `[...rows]`.
- Async panels: module-level loader functions; `useEffect` deps on stable `reloadKey` only — not inline `load` arrows.

**Helper-only tests** (builders, route parsers, grid contract JSON) **do not satisfy** layer 2. A dynamic import smoke test **does not satisfy** layer 1.

**Ops pairing:** when `generate` adds migrations/seeds, document and run bootstrap refresh before declaring data-dependent tabs done (`alembic upgrade head` + scope promote script).
